10 REM QRCODE IN ITS THREE SIZES. A KEY SHOWS THE NEXT
20 FOR I=1 TO 3:READ U$,P
30 CLS 5:QRCODE U$
40 IF P>0 THEN PRINT@P,UCASE$(U$);
50 IF INKEY$="" THEN 50
60 NEXT:CLS
